  "intro": "Nine weeks in and the standings are a crime scene. One 9-0 fraud, one man who spent $54 on a backup, and a six-game losing streak still sitting on $88 of unspent FAAB like it earns interest. This is sample content \u2014 connect the Yahoo league and the Executioner files a real one every Tuesday.",
