    "title": "Congrats On Peaking In The Regular Season. Again.",
    "body": "9-0 and insufferable about it. You have outscored the league by 65 points and you will still find a way to lose in the semifinals to someone who started a player on bye. History does not repeat, but your playoff collapses do.",
