    "title": "$54 On A Backup. Fifty. Four.",
    "body": "You dropped more than half your remaining budget on a handcuff whose starter is listed as day-to-day, which is also how we would describe your grip on this roster. 79.3 points this week. A high school JV team drafting by jersey color does better.",
